      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is reference image.\n\nIf an avatar owener overrides root position.z in PRONEIDLE and PRONEFWD, this position displacement is some extent corrected. This workaround, however, causes the below issues if the avatar has dynamic bones.\n\n• The dynamic bones will randomly vibrate.\n• The avatar’s meshes (including meshes not applying dynamic bones) blink and disappear.\n\n* Theres increase with time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
